#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:1
#, fuzzy
msgid "How to get a backtrace in Krita using the dr. MinGW debugger."
msgstr "Kako priti nazaj v Krita z uporabo dr MinGW razhroščevalnik."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:13
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Backers"
msgid "Backtrace"
msgstr "_Sledenje za nazaj"

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:13
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Razhrošči"

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:18
msgid "Dr. MinGW Debugger"
msgstr "Razhroščevalnik Dr. MinGW"

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The information on this page applies only to the Windows release of Krita. "
"Usually, the %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kritacrash.log log file will contain enough "
"information for the developers to get an idea of why Krita crashed. Using "
"the debug package is only needed when more precise information is needed."
msgstr ""
"Informacije na tej strani veljajo samo za izdajo operacijskega sistema "
"Windows Krita. Običajno bo %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kritacrash.log dnevniška datoteka "
"vsebovala dovolj informacij za razvijalce, da bodo dobili idejo, zakaj se je "
"Krita zrušila. Uporaba paketa za odpravljanje napak je potrebna le, če so "
"potrebne bolj natančne informacije."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:26
msgid "Using the Debug Package"
msgstr "Uporaba paketa za odpravljanje napak"

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:28
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you have your Krita version installed and you want to get a backtrace, "
"it's best to download a portable version (either the latest release, or the "
"one that someone told you to try, for example Krita Next or Krita Plus "
"package). Alongside downloading the portable version, download the debug "
"symbols package, too. It should be located in the same place you download "
"Krita. You can see which is which by checking the end of the name of the ZIP "
"file - debug symbols package always ends with *-dbg.zip*."
msgstr ""
"Če imate nameščeno različico Krita in želite dobiti backtrace, je najbolje, "
"da prenesete prenosno različico (bodisi najnovejšo izdajo, ali tisto, ki vam "
"je nekdo rekel, da poskusite, na primer Krita Next ali Krita Plus paket). "
"Poleg prenosa prenosne različice prenesite tudi paket simbolov za "
"odpravljanje napak. Nahajati se mora na istem mestu, kot ga prenesete Krita. "
"Lahko vidite, kateri je, s preverjanjem konca imena ZIP datoteke - paket "
"simbolov za odpravljanje napak se vedno konča z *-dbg.zip*."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:33
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Links to the debug packages should be available on the release announcement "
"news item on https://krita.org/, along with the release packages. You can "
"find debug packages for any release either in https://download.kde.org/"
"stable/krita for stable releases or in https://download.kde.org/unstable/"
"krita for unstable releases (for example beta versions). Portable ZIP and "
"debug ZIP are found next to each other."
msgstr ""
"Povezave do paketov za odpravljanje napak morajo biti na voljo v sporočilu o "
"objavi na https://krita.org/, skupaj s paketi za izdajo. Pakete za "
"odpravljanje napak za vsako izdajo lahko najdete v https://download.kde.org/"
"stable/krita za stabilne izdaje ali v https://download.kde.org/unstable/"
"krita za neusmiljene izdaje (na primer beta različice). Prenosni ZIP in "
"razhroščevalski ZIP sta najdena drug ob drugem."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:34
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make sure you’ve downloaded the same version of debug package for the "
"portable package you intend to debug / get a better backtrace."
msgstr ""
"Prepričajte se, da ste prenesli isto različico paketa za odpravljanje napak "
"za prenosni paket, ki ga nameravate odpraviti / dobiti boljšo backtrace."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:35
msgid "Extract the portable Krita."
msgstr "Izvlecite prenosno Krito."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:36
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Extract the files from the debug symbols package inside the portable Krita "
"main directory, where the sub-directories *bin*, *lib* and *share* is "
"located, like in the figures below:"
msgstr ""
"Izvleči datoteke iz paketa simbolov za odpravljanje napak znotraj prenosnega "
"glavnega imenika Krita, kjer se nahajajo podimeni *bin*, *lib* in *share* "
"kot na spodnjih številkah:"

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:42
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After extracting the files, check the ``bin`` dir and make sure you see the "
"``.debug`` dir inside. If you don't see it, you probably extracted to the "
"wrong place."
msgstr ""
"Po izvleček datotek, preverite \"bin\" dir in se prepričajte, da vidite ''."
"debug'' dir v notranjosti. Če ga ne vidiš, si verjetno izvlečen na napačno "
"mesto."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:46
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Getting Started"
msgid "Getting a Backtrace"
msgstr "Prvi koraki"

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:51
msgid ""
"When there is a crash, Krita might appear to be unresponsive for a short "
"time, ranging from a few seconds to a few minutes, before the crash dialog "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"Ko pride do sesutja, se Krita morda za kratek čas ne odziva, kar sega od "
"nekaj sekund do nekaj minut, preden se pojavi pogovorno okno za sesutje."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:55
msgid "An example of the crash dialog."
msgstr "Primer pogovornega okna za sesutje."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If Krita keeps on being unresponsive for more than a few minutes, it might "
"actually be locked up, which may not give a backtrace. In that situation, "
"you have to close Krita manually. Continue to follow the following "
"instructions to check whether it was a crash or not."
msgstr ""
"Če Krita ne odziva več kot nekaj minut, je morda zaklenjen, kar morda ne bo "
"vrnilo sledi. V tej situaciji moraš Krito zapreti ročno. Nadaljujte z "
"naslednjimi navodili, da preverite, ali je bila nesreča ali ne."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:59
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Open Windows Explorer and type ``%LocalAppData%`` (without quotes) on the "
"address bar and press the :kbd:`Enter` key."
msgstr ""
"Odprite Raziskovalec in v naslovno vrstico vnesite »%LocalAppData%« (brez "
"narekovajev) in pritisnite tipko :kbd:'Enter'."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:63
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Find the file ``kritacrash.log`` (it might appear as simply ``kritacrash`` "
"depending on your settings.)"
msgstr ""
"Poiščite datoteko \"kritacrash.log\" (lahko se prikaže kot preprosto "
"\"kritacrash\" glede na nastavitve.)"

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:64
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Open the file with Notepad and scroll to the bottom, then scroll up to the "
"first occurrence of “Error occurred on <time>” or the dashes."
msgstr ""
"Odprite datoteko z beležnico in se pomaknite na dno, nato pa se pomaknite do "
"prvega pojava »Prišlo je do napake na <time>« ali pomišljaj.</time>"

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:68
#, fuzzy
msgid "Start of backtrace."
msgstr "Začetek zaodločitve."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:70
msgid "Check the time and make sure it matches the time of the crash."
msgstr "Preverite čas in se prepričajte, da se ujema s časom sesutja."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:74
#, fuzzy
msgid "End of backtrace."
msgstr "Konec zaodloka."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The text starting from this line to the end of the file is the most recent "
"backtrace."
msgstr ""
"Besedilo, ki se začne od te vrstice do konca datoteke, je najnovejši "
"backtrace."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:78
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If ``kritacrash.log`` does not exist, or a backtrace with a matching time "
"does not exist, then you don’t have a backtrace. This means Krita was very "
"likely locked up, and a crash didn’t actually happen. In this case, make a "
"bug report too."
msgstr ""
"Če \"kritacrash.log\" ne obstaja, ali backtrace z ujemajoč čas ne obstaja, "
"potem nimate backtrace. To pomeni, da je bila Krita zelo zaklenjena in da se "
"nesreča dejansko ni zgodila. V tem primeru naredite tudi poročilo o napakah."

#: ../../reference_manual/dr_minw_debugger.rst:79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the backtrace looks truncated, or there is nothing after the time, it "
"means there was a crash and the crash handler was creating the stack trace "
"before being closed manually. In this case, try to re-trigger the crash and "
"wait longer until the crash dialog appears."
msgstr ""
"Če je backtrace videti okrnjena, ali po času ni ničesar, pomeni, da je bil "
"strmoglavljenje in upravljalec zrušitev je ustvaril sled stack, preden je "
"bil ročno zaprt. V tem primeru poskusite znova sprožiti strmoglavljenje in "
"počakajte dlje, da se prikaže pogovorno okno za strmoglavljenje."
